    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1933249302635405546",
      "url": "https://x.com/WorldWingman/status/1933249302635405546",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/WorldWingman/status/1933249302635405546",
      "text": "I’ve been thinking about which cities are best for guys just starting to date abroad- where the culture is more feminine, women are warm and open, and the dating vibe is chill. \n\n🇵🇭 Manila, Philippines: English is widely spoken, it's a huge city and lots to do. Dating apps work well and same goes for in person interactions. \n🇵🇭 Cebu City, Philippines: Same but smaller city and closer to beaches. \n🇹🇭 Bangkok, Thailand: Gold standard of lifestyle, food, culture, dating, social life and things to do. Dating apps work well as does daygame and nightgame. English is spoken enough. \n🇮🇩 Jakarta, Indonesia: Urban sprawl with terrible traffic but warm, feminine women. \n🇵🇪 Lima, Peru: One of the safer cities in Latin America. Plenty of volume as it's a huge city. You'll want to speak some at least some basic Spanish to get the most out of it. \n🇲🇽 Mexico City, Mexico: Not my favorite city but not a bad beginner option. One of the best cities for English being spoken in Latin America. Still ideal to speak some basic Spanish before going. \n\n#DatingAdvice",
